            "description": "⭐ KEY ENDPOINT\n\nFetches live timetable from Madrasati using stored cookies.\nAutomatically syncs to local database.\n\nReturns encrypted_token, time_table_id, subject_id, lesson_madrasati_id needed for /prepare.\n\nRequires active Madrasati session (call Connect first)."
          },
          "response": []
